    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "a95d4981-7cc8-31c2-a721-ba0ffd84d804",
                "word": "eureka",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "a9cd402b-8c31-4bd1-bc3e-32006d3e52f6",
                        "entry_id": "a95d4981-7cc8-31c2-a721-ba0ffd84d804",
                        "tags": [
                            "canonical"
                        ],
                        "form": "eureka!"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cfb7d0d5-1cbc-3401-ab78-9e4e02e8179d",
                        "entry_id": "a95d4981-7cc8-31c2-a721-ba0ffd84d804",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An exclamation indicating a sudden discovery."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d83534df-a2a8-4623-9488-847423a01304",
                                "sense_id": "cfb7d0d5-1cbc-3401-ab78-9e4e02e8179d",
                                "text": "Eureka! I have found it! What I mean / To say is, not that love is idleness, / But that in love such idleness has been / An accessory, as I have cause to guess."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "27315a9a-0342-440f-95a2-5f85d850398f",
                                "sense_id": "cfb7d0d5-1cbc-3401-ab78-9e4e02e8179d",
                                "text": "\"Eureka!\" he cried, his teeth shining through his beard. \"Gentlemen, you may congratulate me and we may congratulate each other. The problem is solved.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "79c2f174-b75f-4800-a2ac-a167711cdab6",
                                "sense_id": "cfb7d0d5-1cbc-3401-ab78-9e4e02e8179d",
                                "text": "A page is turned - eureka, a snatch of tune / is playing itself, the piss-proud syllables / are unveiling a difficult prosody."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cb92f499-2fe8-43ef-9c52-374c88488dfb",
                        "source_entry_id": "a95d4981-7cc8-31c2-a721-ba0ffd84d804",
                        "source_sense_id": "cfb7d0d5-1cbc-3401-ab78-9e4e02e8179d",
                        "source_sense_description": "exclamation indicating sudden discovery",
                        "target_lang_word": "heuréka",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "de7b4e12-d4d1-4af9-b9fa-e328dd2bb648",
                        "source_entry_id": "a95d4981-7cc8-31c2-a721-ba0ffd84d804",
                        "source_sense_id": "cfb7d0d5-1cbc-3401-ab78-9e4e02e8179d",
                        "source_sense_description": "exclamation indicating sudden discovery",
                        "target_lang_word": "eurêka",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "eurêka",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a262534-6fc3-3e44-81d6-6c140bd21f6d",
                                        "entry_id": "20758b9d-b56d-3619-b5bf-6215e9c1a7c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exclamation proférée à l’instant où l’on trouve la solution à un problème, à une difficulté."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd55b20b-10e6-450d-a64b-4fa4c16e7b7c",
                                                "sense_id": "1a262534-6fc3-3e44-81d6-6c140bd21f6d",
                                                "text": "À cette pensée, à l'imitation de Sterne, qui a bien un peu copié Archimède, j'ai fait craquer mes doigts; j'ai jeté mon bonnet en l'air, et je me suis écrié : « Eurêka » (j'ai trouvé) !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d219bea7-34c7-4ead-8365-0e45281fd7be",
                                                "sense_id": "1a262534-6fc3-3e44-81d6-6c140bd21f6d",
                                                "text": "Il se demeure, hélas ! une énigme à lui-même,\nEt, quel que soit le Dieu que son âme invoqua,\nIl n’a pu jusqu’ici, sondant le grand problème,\nTriomphant et joyeux s’écrier : Euréka !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "179d94e2-009b-4521-882a-d89500a7728f",
                                                "sense_id": "1a262534-6fc3-3e44-81d6-6c140bd21f6d",
                                                "text": "Soudain, le savant les vit. Alors, lâchant sa chaise qui tomba bruyamment, il leva les bras en l’air et hurla :\n— Adrien ! Cécile !… Euréka !… J’ai trouvé !…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16b13f23-a47f-4ab7-a04d-41ffacaf68b7",
                                                "sense_id": "1a262534-6fc3-3e44-81d6-6c140bd21f6d",
                                                "text": "Il réfléchit, il s'exalte, il crie « euréka »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "eurêka",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2345c189-c3a3-3ea0-a61a-1f621f177554",
                                        "entry_id": "85b9e50a-af01-3917-a7e1-3d831283a98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Solution à un problème, laquelle se présente soudainement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f26f0a43-c6c5-4a32-8536-6e850bfa31f1",
                                                "sense_id": "2345c189-c3a3-3ea0-a61a-1f621f177554",
                                                "text": "Il n'a pas encore trouvé l’euréka qui fixe la pensée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1b8d3764-1b79-4af3-a83b-91c862bb0ff9",
                        "source_entry_id": "a95d4981-7cc8-31c2-a721-ba0ffd84d804",
                        "source_sense_id": "cfb7d0d5-1cbc-3401-ab78-9e4e02e8179d",
                        "source_sense_description": "exclamation indicating sudden discovery",
                        "target_lang_word": "heureka",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
